        "TileImage": "$($repository a5cdd554-ae92-45d2-be6b-3385245e1277).Image",
        "Description": "Five stylists. Five identical faces. One very fashionable problem.\n\n\rSomewhere backstage at the Paris fashion show, five men look like they&#39;ve been styled by the same person — right down to the last hair.\n\n\rAgent 47, finding them is like looking for a hairpin in a haystack.\n\n\rJust remember: tonight, the only thing getting cut isn&#39;t hair.",
